"entity": {
"name": "TGS ASA",
"description": "TGS ASA engages in the provision of geoscientific data products and services to oil and gas exploration companies. It operates through the following geographical segments: Multi-client, Marine Data Acquisition, New Energy Solutions, Imaging and Shared Services. The Multi-client segment initiate, acquire, process, market and sell energy data to multiple customers. The Marine Data Acquisition segment acquire proprietary oceanbottom node (OBN) and towed streamer data for clients using advanced acquisition technologies and state-of-the-art equipment. The New Energy Solutions segment leverage advanced geophysical, digital and high-performance computing technologies to deliver sophisticated geophysical solutions tailored to the needs of energy companies. The Imaging segment provide high-quality market intelligence, wind and metocean data acquisition and digital transformation services to clients. The Shared Services segment provide corporate and other services. The company was founded in 1981 and is headquartered in Oslo, Norway.",
"rbics_econ": "Energy",
"rbics_sector": "Upstream Energy",
"rbics_subsector": "Support Activities for Oil and Gas Operations",
"rbics_indgrp": "Oil and Gas Operations Support Activities",
